  lessonID: 1
  cocID: COC_01
  lessonTitle: OHS Policies and Procedures
  description: "This lesson introduces Occupational Health and Safety (OHS) practices to help protect workers, others, and equipment from potential hazards."
  lessonSceneName: LessonScene
  requiredGoldLessonID: 0
  learningObjectives:
  - "• Discuss the Occupational Health and Safety (OHS) policies and procedures."
  - "• Elaborate the three steps used to manage health and safety at work."
  - "• Point out the common hazards encountered by computer technicians and users."
  - "• Identify the elements of the Occupational Health and Safety Standards."
  - "• Explain the 5S Principles."
